{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act41side_level_act41side_03_end",
  "groupId": "act41side",
  "stageId": "act41side_03",
  "title": "惶惑与冲动",
  "storyCode": "EA-3",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act41side/level_act41side_03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "88f9ccfb07f1de1d3764489fcbbbad5cf0da2e07b71bb5990043a21c1d706c77",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎哟！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是谁——提奥？你不看路的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱、抱歉！罗里先生，我想去拉格兰街碰碰运气，看能不能买到点土豆——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "滚开！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车夫的声音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小心！驮兽受惊了！快躲开！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "赶车的，你疯了吗，你差点撞死我！给我停下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "居然就这么跑了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "罗里先生，我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈，哈哈，真是恶有恶报，被撞的居然是你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走，小子，这下你哪也去不了了，跟我去见深池的人，我要把你这个叛徒交给他们，这样我就有土豆可以——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不对，不能走大路！万一这个间谍被其他人抢走......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "男人一把拎起男孩的领子，不顾男孩痛苦的呻吟，拖着他走向平日无人经过的小巷深处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也真的是邪门，为什么还是走不出去？难道我记错路了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遥远的争吵声",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别抢！把土豆还我！你自己去粮店买，你看那里还有剩下的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遥远的争吵声",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还给我！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还有剩下的？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "男人看向声音传来的方向，又看了看一条胳膊攥在自己手里，几乎已经没了人样的男孩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "快死了......快死了还能从他嘴里撬出来情报吗？深池的老爷们还能愿意给我口吃的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......叛徒，算你运气好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "男人甩开孩子那反而抓紧了自己袖口的手，快步跑向声音传来的方向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好痛......我的腿......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不行，站不起来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "艾玛阿姨......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......谁叫我？谁？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我已经照你说的做了，我已经做了！别再来缠着我了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "艾玛......阿姨！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "提奥？你怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我被驮兽车给撞了，然后又被人丢到了这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不是维多利亚人的间谍，艾玛阿姨。求你救救我，带我去找库林先生，好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "维多利亚人......间谍？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原来这么快啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "艾玛阿姨，我好痛，真的好痛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道维多利亚人害了大家，大家都不喜欢我，没人愿意听我说话，更没人愿意碰我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是能不能......至少把库林先生叫过来，我好痛，而且好冷......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "艾玛阿姨，等我长大了，我会去找维多利亚人报仇的，我会去替尼亚尔叔叔......报仇的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（深呼吸）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "提奥，如果死的只有尼亚尔，也许我会帮你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提奥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "艾玛......阿姨？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你只知道尼亚尔死在战争里，可还有更多人，他们没上战场，也死掉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因为你们维多利亚人封锁了商路，直到现在还在封锁，所有人都在挨饿，包括我，包括......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "尼亚尔留给我的......我肚子里的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他也饿死了，被你们维多利亚人活活饿死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，找其他人去帮你叫库林吧。他们不像我，他们都是好人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......很好很好的好人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "艾玛，竟然是艾玛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为什么她会变成这样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "库林，我不是给她辩解，但那天经过那里的人，肯定不止她一个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊，不止她一个......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我是不是说错话了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，你没说错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你之前还想带提奥离开，是吗？你看见什么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别人欺负他。不是小孩子之间的打打闹闹，是大人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我在第一次看见提奥被欺负的时候就冲了上去，我以为这样的事情......不会再发生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "实际上......发生过很多次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "之前我只是一直有种很不好的预感，我觉得提奥不属于这座城市，纳斯尔纱可能容不下他，谁知道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道了。你走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "库林？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我说我知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我说我知道了！走！现在就走！让我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......一个人待着，好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "铁匠怔怔地站着，四周静谧，只剩下火焰的噼啪声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "提奥，我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他错过的事情太多，无法理解的事也太多，已经无力去厘清其中的因果与关窍。\n他只意识到一件事，自己什么都没做到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我算什么英雄？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊，你算什么英雄？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "铁匠环顾四周，工坊内空无一人，唯有巨龙的雕塑正用空空如也的眼眶斜睨着他，宛如质疑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巨龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你算什么英雄？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我算......什么英雄？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巨龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "英雄会放任一个每天面对无数敌意的孩子，在时不时对他口吐恶言的人群中东游西逛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巨龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "英雄会让粮食在自己鼻子底下运出城，直到城内无粮可吃，还只能向邻居分发几枚可怜的土豆？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巨龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "英雄会在城内乱作一团的时候窝在家里埋头打铁，就为了把自己的名字刻在雕像的基座上，满足那点可怜的虚荣心？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......我绝不是为了什么虚荣，我是为了......为了能用英雄的名号，去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巨龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "去像你当时对涅梅丝说的那样，“为那些在战争中失去了一切的同胞谋幸福”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巨龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就像现在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......就像......现在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巨龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你要保护的弱小已经不在人世。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巨龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你要伸张的正义，已经没入黑暗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巨龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你要为之谋福利的同胞......艾玛，罗里，他们真的还是你的同胞吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巨龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们难道不是活在过去的死人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "活在过去的......死人？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巨龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们甚至不像你，你那颗虚荣的心还梦想着未来，而他们？他们不过是一群活在过去的行尸走肉罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巨龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的同胞是个拿着从火里抢出来的古董刀四处比划的可怜人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巨龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或者，为了一个流产的胎儿，就对一个无辜的孩子见死不救的走私犯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巨龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "又或者，面对变故，已经只能理解仇恨这一种逻辑的“城里人”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巨龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在就抓个人来，问问他以后的打算，猜猜你能听见什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "铁匠从不离手的大锤当啷一声落在地上。\n他死死盯住巨龙的头颅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真正把人们困在过去的......难道不是你吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我收集同胞们生活用的碗盆，点燃同胞们取暖照明用的燃料......就只为了哺育你这......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怪物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "粮食我不知道，但金属、燃料......\n对，是我，我亲手把锅，把碗，把人们的生活喂到你的嘴里，喂你长到如此巨大......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "连我自己的生活也被你吞吃下去，紧接着，就是提奥的生命......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "提奥，提奥......\n对，是我养大了这个怪物，这怪物又把你的命吞掉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在，它又要在夏末节那天站上广场，张开双翼，它说整座城的居民都会被它变成只能活在过去的死人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巨龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怪物，你说得对。我的确不是英雄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只是个可怜的、虚荣的骗子。过去我骗其他人，现在，我骗的是自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但人们需要我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巨龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "需要你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们需要一个英雄，去叫醒他们，告诉他们，战争已经结束了，现在重要的是明天，是未来，是即将开始的生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巨龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就凭你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就凭我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "铁匠决绝地自炉膛边离开。他拿了一条最粗大、最结实的铁索，又拖着铁索，回到巨龙那仍然斜睨着他的头颅下边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "跟我走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巨龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "去哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "广场。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巨龙",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今天并不是夏末节。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不能再等，再等下去，你那些不祥的预言只会成真。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "跟我走......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "然后，我会将你拆掉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "库林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我会让你把生活还给所有人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "巨龙纹丝不动，但铁匠分明看到，那头颅向着他低了低，既像轻蔑，又像邀请。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "苇草、涅梅丝，我回来了。库林的状态很不好，你们也许该去看看他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们那边的情况呢？城里人怎么样了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "人们仍然在抓间谍......维多利亚间谍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们疯了！说到底，塔拉人，维多利亚人，不都是人吗？战争已经结束了，我们难道还要这样继续你死我活下去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "涅梅丝，去解释给人们听，让他们吃不上饭的深池已经被红龙惩治了，粮食也——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "布莉吉，别再说深池这个词，一次也别说。这是领袖的命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且......说到底，粮食的事，我也只是在庆功会上听见他们窃窃私语罢了，没有证明，没有审判。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "甚至连粮食到底是怎么回来的，我都一无所知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "更别说深——那些人不在了的消息，现在根本就没传到人们的耳朵里......我到底该怎么解释？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果道理讲不通，就只能硬来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您是说？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我回到这里，原本抱着再也不做影子的打算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但到了现在这个地步，如果真正的领袖始终不愿露面承担责任，我就必须出面，至少暂时安抚混乱的人心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对了，那位库林先生呢？他毕竟是公认的英雄，如果他能帮我们一把，事情会顺利很多的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他应该就在自己的工坊。我带路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "布莉吉，你趁现在赶紧出城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......如果我们和库林都没法成功，你和人群之间......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我懂了，因为城里的人不喜欢我，我可能会碍事，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，布莉吉，我没有说你碍事的意思——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但你说得对，我就是会碍事啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别担心，我现在就走，去黑林碰碰运气。也许它现在就愿意放行了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "库林！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "库林......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他不在吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "两人瞠目结舌。\n工坊的门......\n不，工坊正对着她们的那面墙，已经不在了。\n那面本该在雕像完工时才拆掉的墙此时已经化作一堆瓦砾，而那些瓦砾掩盖不住的，是一道通向广场方向的拖痕。\n一道宽如道路的，长长的拖痕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
